    "market_commentary": "The SSY Atlantic Capesize Index fell to its lowest levels since 15 February 2021, down by 433 points from last week to 6,739. SSY’s assessed roundvoyage rate decreased by $3,250/day to $5,750/day and the fronthaul rate dropped $3,150/day to $19,850/day.",
